    rdfs:label "RF-03" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-03" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must detect changes in the agent's context, including movement, loss of connectivity, zone changes, changes in the proximity of nodes and transitions between urban, rural or restricted areas." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-CTX-01,
        mc:M-MODEL-04 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-ZONE-04 .

mc:RF-04 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-04" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-04" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must monitor device state: battery, connectivity, active sensors, availability of parameterized data and local preprocessing capacity." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-DATA-02,
        mc:M-TX-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-DATA-04 .

mc:RF-05 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-05" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-05" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must record the operational state of continuum nodes, including availability, load, communication, residual capacity, resource usage, request queues and operating status. `ComputeOnly` or `Inoperative` states must be explicitly detected so that orchestration can decide whether to delegate, isolate or exclude the node." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-NODE-01,
        mc:M-NODE-02 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-NODE-01 .

mc:RF-10 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-10" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-10" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must distinguish between raw physiological observations and transmissible parameterized data. For these requirements, the local scope is limited to the mobile/wearable device and, when policy permits, the associated Mist tier; raw physiological observations must not be transmitted to Edge, Fog or Cloud." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-DATA-01,
        mc:M-TX-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-DATA-01 .

mc:RF-14 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-14" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-14" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must evaluate prediction quality and separately record prediction confidence, estimated error, local feedback and the observed quality of the model used. Weights used for multicriteria selection must not substitute for observed quality metrics." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-AUD-01,
        mc:M-METRIC-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-MODEL-08 .

mc:RF-24 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-24" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-24" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must version models, record their update dates and support rollback to previous versions in the event of degradation, errors or policy non-compliance." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-MODEL-05,
        mc:M-VAL-04 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-FL-08 .

mc:RF-29 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-29" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-29" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must collect system metrics for computational stress studies, including resource usage, load, queues, latency, residual capacity and migration cost." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-METRIC-01,
        mc:M-TIME-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-OPS-05 .

mc:RF-31 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-31" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-31" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must support simulation of urban scenarios with high mobility, high load, loss of connectivity, rural zones, restricted zones, Edge saturation and Edge-to-Fog migration. Scenarios S1–S17 must be defined in an unambiguously referenced, versioned artifact or annex to make this requirement reproducible." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-VAL-04,
        mc:M-VAL-06 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-VAL-07 .

mc:RF-32 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-32" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-32" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must represent consent through a consent-aware model based on processing ranges, including local consent, community aggregation, global aggregation and explicit denial/revocation. Users must be able to grant or revoke authorization for data categories, purposes, validity intervals and the maximum permitted continuum range." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-CONS-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-CONS-01 .

mc:RF-33 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-33" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-33" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "Every user must be linked to exactly one effective semantic contract per processing purpose at any given time. Historical contracts and contracts for different purposes are allowed, but their validity intervals must not result in more than one effective contract for the same user and purpose at the same instant." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-CONS-01,
        mc:M-TIME-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-CONS-02 .

mc:RF-34 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-34" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-34" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The semantic contract must link the user, consent range, processing purpose and policies governing the processing." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-CONS-01,
        mc:M-GOV-02 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-CONS-03 .

mc:RF-37 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-37" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-37" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "Every resource, policy, permission, model, service or session requiring consent must declare the minimum required range through `requiresConsentRange`." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-CONS-03 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-CONS-05 .

mc:RF-39 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-39" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-39" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must represent policies as explicit, queryable semantic entities." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-GOV-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-GOV-01 .

mc:RF-40 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-40" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-40" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "Every formal policy must be classified under exactly one semantic type: obligation, abstention or prohibition. In this model, an obligation requires an action to be performed; an abstention requires an optional action not to be performed unless explicitly enabled; a prohibition declares an action impermissible. The three types must be distinguishable and disjoint in validation." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-GOV-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-GOV-01 .

mc:RF-45 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-45" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-45" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "Every `NodeState` used in MAPE-K decisions must record a historical trust value." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-TRUST-01,
        mc:M-VAL-04 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-NODE-03 .

mc:RF-57 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-57" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-57" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "Every model gradient leaving a mobile device must have undergone anonymization and noise addition." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-FL-03,
        mc:M-ID-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-FL-03 .

mc:RF-58 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-58" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-58" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "Every protected FL session must be linked to an explicit privacy or anonymization mechanism." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-FL-03,
        mc:M-ID-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-FL-05 .

mc:RF-60 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-60" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-60" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must prevent raw physiological observations from leaving the local scope defined in RF-10; therefore, they must not be transmitted to Edge, Fog or Cloud nodes. Only authorized parameterized data or model updates may leave the local scope." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-DATA-01,
        mc:M-TX-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-DATA-01 .

mc:RF-61 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-61" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-61" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "All parameterized data, gradients or updates transmitted outside the local scope must use pseudonymous or anonymized identifiers. Direct personal identifiers must not accompany parameterized data, gradients or federated updates, and a violation query must be available to detect any breach of this rule." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-ID-01,
        mc:M-TX-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-DATA-02 .

mc:RF-63 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-63" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-63" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The delegation event must record the source, destination, cause, start of validity and recovery condition. `validTo` must represent the effective closure of the delegation and may remain unset while it is active. If a planned expiration differs from the actual closure, it must be represented by an additional explicit temporal limit rather than ambiguously reusing `validTo`." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-DELEG-01,
        mc:M-TIME-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-AUD-02 .

mc:RF-64 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-64" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-64" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must close or invalidate a delegation when the source node's recovery condition is met or its planned expiration is reached. At that point, it must record `validTo` as the effective closure time." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-DELEG-02 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-AUD-03 .

mc:RF-65 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-65" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-65" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must represent detected MAPE-K symptoms and link them to policies and evaluations." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-AUD-02 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-AUD-05 .

mc:RF-69 a mc:FunctionalRequirement,
        mc:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-69" ;
    mc:definedInArtifact mc:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    mc:requirementIdentifier "RF-69" ;
    mc:requirementStatement "The system must expose the ontology through a SPARQL 1.1 endpoint. Apache Jena Fuseki is the reference environment for reproducibility; equivalent endpoints may be used in operation provided they remain compatible with RDF/OWL/Turtle and SPARQL 1.1 and pass the same validation battery." ;
    mc:tracedToMechanism mc:M-VAL-01 ;
    mc:tracedToPolicy mc:P-VAL-01 .

